## 🏢 halls.uonbi.ac.ke - CRITICAL WEAKNESSES

### 🔴 CRITICAL VULNERABILITIES

#### 1. Drupal Installer Accessible
| Detail | Value |
|--------|-------|
| **URL** | `https://halls.uonbi.ac.ke/core/install.php` |
| **Status** | HTTP 200 OK |
| **Risk** | An attacker can access the Drupal installer |

**Accessible Paths Confirmed:**
```
✅ core/install.php -> 200
✅ core/install.php?lang=en -> 200
✅ core/install.php?profile=standard -> 200
✅ core/install.php?op=choose-language -> 200
✅ core/install.php?op=configure -> 200
✅ core/install.php?op=install -> 200
✅ install.php -> 301 (redirects to core/install.php)
```

**Impact:** 
- Potential site reinstallation
- Database configuration exposure
- Admin account creation
- Complete site takeover

